Qvtxr_QnK24U_Tj-RBnuaVQjtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLXnNBD7JzC2z0TpW_Im3Tsefd5oi5gVm4zl_DXUzOaFw&oe=6AA2B59A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Doughmen Chaos", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Doughmen Chaos invites players into an expansive virtual reality realm where they embark on adventures with friends. Using hand movements, players explore a diverse map filled with mysteries and challenges. Beyond exploration, the game offers customization options for character cosmetics and adrenaline-pumping game modes like \"Rising Lava.\" Whether scaling mountains or navigating urban landscapes, the world promises endless excitement. In addition to individual challenges, players can connect and compete in a vibrant community, enhancing the social experience. With its immersive gameplay and diverse activities, \"Doughmen Chaos\" delivers an unforgettable VR gaming experience.", "short_description": "Doughmen Chaos Is a vr game where u explore a big map with ur friends, Move with your hands, Buy cosmetics, And play gamemodes such as rising lava!"}]}, "developer_name": "carterrg", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://superleoparon.wixsite.com/doughmenchaos/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "carterrg", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://superleoparon.wixsite.com/doughmenchaos", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes"